        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Roof inspections in Utah typically range from $0 (complimentary from local contractors) to $150\u2013$500 for independent or certified assessments. Costs vary depending on whether you choose a basic visual check, a drone scan, or a detailed hard-copy report required for real estate sales or insurance claims .",
