        "snippet": "Key Cost Drivers in Utah"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Roof Pitch & Height: Steeper slopes common in snowy mountain regions require extra safety gear and labor."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Weather Wear : High-elevation UV exposure, freeze-thaw cycles, and heavy snow loads make thorough flashing and attic evaluations essential."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Purpose of Inspection: Routine checkups are frequently free, whereas legally binding or insurance-certified claims reports carry a fee.",
